        }
      ],
      "updated": 1790166394114,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "## TechSpec — Technical Specification\n\n### Stack\n| Camada    | Tecnologia              |\n|-----------|--------------------------|\n| Frontend  | [ex: React + TypeScript] |\n| Backend   | [ex: Node.js + Fastify]  |\n| Banco     | [ex: PostgreSQL]         |\n| ORM       | [ex: Prisma]             |",
      "fontSize": 20.932700892857152,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "## TechSpec — Technical Specification\n\n### Stack\n| Camada    | Tecnologia              |\n|-----------|--------------------------|\n| Frontend  | [ex: React + TypeScript] |\n| Backend   | [ex: Node.js + Fastify]  |\n| Banco     | [ex: PostgreSQL]         |\n| ORM       | [ex: Prisma]             |",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b0T",
      "autoResize": false
    },
    {
      "id": "v3W94qt3raK3Ghk7785m3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11299.38384440482,
      "y": 6008.708010172213,
      "width": 863.0906888822817,
      "height": 601.8151506696431,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1832994509,
      "version": 1194,
      "versionNonce": 1456177491,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "RFlIXx1G5QBV758A3Trhg",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1790166394114,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "### Backend\n\n#### Endpoint\nMETHOD /api/v[versão]/[recurso]\n\n#### Request Body\n```json\n{\n  \"campo1\": \"tipo\",\n  \"campo2\": \"tipo\"\n}\n```\n\n#### Responses\n| Status | Descrição           | Body\n|\n|--------|---------------------|-------------------------------------|\n| 201    | Criado com sucesso  | { id, campo1, campo2, created_at }\n|\n| 400    | Dados inválidos     | { error: { code, message, details } }\n|\n| 409    | Conflito            | { error: { code, message } }\n|",
      "fontSize": 20.932700892857152,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "### Backend\n\n#### Endpoint\nMETHOD /api/v[versão]/[recurso]\n\n#### Request Body\n```json\n{\n  \"campo1\": \"tipo\",\n  \"campo2\": \"tipo\"\n}\n```\n\n#### Responses\n| Status | Descrição           | Body                                      |\n|--------|---------------------|-------------------------------------|\n| 201    | Criado com sucesso  | { id, campo1, campo2, created_at }         |\n| 400    | Dados inválidos     | { error: { code, message, details } }      |\n| 409    | Conflito            | { error: { code, message } }               |",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b0U",
      "autoResize": false
    },
    {
      "id": "f4J9joGhg3sytN3cfd3RO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11295.75103190482,
      "y": 6706.935316719832,
      "width": 901.1831367989483,
      "height": 209.32700892857153,
